'Agent 的定义与最小循环':'Agent Definition and Minimum Loop','理解由 LLM 驱动的工具调用闭环':'Understand the LLM-driven tool and feedback loop','已整理定义、个人理解与最小循环伪代码；还没有运行实现或验证结果。':'Definitions, personal understanding, and pseudocode are documented. No implementation has been run or verified.','什么使一次 LLM 对话成为 Agent？最小循环需要哪些步骤？':'What turns an LLM conversation into an Agent, and what does its minimum loop require?','对照 Anthropic、LangChain、OpenAI Agents SDK 和 Google ADK 的公开定义，整理自己的理解、流程图与 Python 伪代码。':'I compared public definitions from Anthropic, LangChain, OpenAI Agents SDK, and Google ADK, then wrote my understanding, a flow diagram, and Python pseudocode.','四种定义分别强调动态决策、模型与工具的循环、配置与运行行为、面向目标的自主行动。这些是不同侧重点的概括。':'The four descriptions emphasize dynamic decisions, model-tool loops, configuration and runtime behavior, and autonomous action toward goals. These are paraphrases with different emphases.','我把 Agent 理解为：在与 LLM 对话的基础上，能够调用外部工具，对外部环境产生反馈，根据反馈进行规划，同时拥有记忆存储机制。':'My understanding: beyond talking to an LLM, an Agent can call external tools, affect the environment, plan from feedback, and use memory.','最小画布采用 User → LLM；LLM 不需要工具时返回最终结果，需要时调用 Tool，把 Tool Result 放回上下文后再次调用 LLM。':'The minimum diagram starts User → LLM. Without a tool call, it returns a final answer. Otherwise it calls a Tool, puts the Tool Result back into context, and calls the LLM again.','已写出说明最小循环的 Python 伪代码；call_llm 和 run_tool 仍是抽象接口，尚未写成可运行程序。':'Python pseudocode explains the loop; call_llm and run_tool are abstract interfaces, so this is not yet runnable.','尚未运行代码或给出测试结果。':'No code run or test result yet.','下一步确定一个具体任务和工具，实现可运行的最小循环；再讨论错误处理、终止条件、持久化记忆与规划。':'Next, choose a concrete task and tool, implement the runnable loop, then examine errors, stopping rules, persistent memory, and planning.','Agent 最底层可以从 LLM 驱动的工具调用与反馈循环理解。当前 messages 保存了本次循环的上下文，但还不是跨会话的持久化记忆。':'The foundation is an LLM-driven tool and feedback loop. messages holds context within this run; it is not persistent memory across sessions.','LLM 动态决定执行过程与工具使用方式。':'The LLM dynamically directs its process and tool use.','模型循环调用工具，直到给定任务完成。':'The model calls tools in a loop until the task is complete.','Agent 是配置了指令、工具及可选运行行为的 LLM。':'An Agent is an LLM configured with instructions, tools, and optional runtime behavior.','Agent 是为实现特定目标而自主行动的执行单元。':'An Agent is an execution unit that acts autonomously toward a goal.','Agent 就是在与 LLM 对话的基础上，可以调用外部工具，对外部环境产生反馈，并根据反馈进行规划，同时拥有记忆存储机制。':'An Agent extends a conversation with an LLM: it can call external tools, affect the environment, plan based on feedback, and use memory.','Agent 最底层，本质上就是一个由 LLM 驱动、能够调用工具并根据结果继续循环的系统。':'At its core, an Agent is an LLM-driven system that can call tools and continue looping based on their results.',
'提出任务并提供上下文':'Provide a task and context','循环需要用户目标与初始消息。':'The loop needs a goal and initial message.','用户任务':'User task','role=user 消息':'role=user message','最小循环的起点':'Starting point of the minimum loop','待可运行实现验证':'Awaiting a runnable implementation','决策核心':'Decision core','决定返回答案或请求工具调用':'Decide whether to answer or request a tool','模型根据已有消息及工具描述选择下一步。':'The model chooses the next step from the messages and tool descriptions.','回答或 tool_calls':'Answer or tool_calls','每次工具结果写回后再次调用':'Call again after each tool result is added','执行模型请求的外部操作':'Execute the external action requested by the model','让系统读取或改变外部环境。':'Allow the system to read or change its environment.','工具执行结果':'Tool execution result','仅在 LLM 需要时调用':'Called only when the LLM requests it','反馈':'Feedback','把工具执行结果放回上下文':'Put the tool result back into context','模型需要看到反馈，才能继续判断下一步。':'The model needs feedback before deciding what to do next.','工具输出、tool_call.id':'Tool output and tool_call.id','role=tool 消息':'role=tool message','写入 messages，再次调用 LLM':'Append to messages, then call the LLM again','模型不再请求工具时返回结果':'Return when the model stops requesting tools','明确循环的结束分支。':'Make the loop’s exit path explicit.','没有 tool_calls 的模型响应':'Model response without tool_calls','满足终止条件后返回用户':'Return to the user when the stop condition is met','系统概念':'System concept','由模型、工具与控制循环构成的系统':'A system made of model, tools, and a control loop','用整体视角理解动态选择、工具调用和反馈。':'Describe dynamic choice, tool use, and feedback as a whole.','目标、消息、工具配置':'Goal, messages, and tool configuration','最终结果或下一步动作':'Final result or next action','概念解释，不是画布上的额外执行节点':'Conceptual explanation, not another execution node in the diagram','当前只完成知识整理':'Only the knowledge record is complete','任务':'Task','无需 Tool → 返回':'No Tool → return','需要 Tool':'Tool required','执行结果':'Execution result','放回上下文，再次调用':'Add to context; call again'
