'知识整理':'Knowledge record','知识整理 · 代码未运行':'Documented · Code not run','知识整理 · 伪代码未运行':'Documented · Pseudocode not run','待实现':'Not implemented','最小 Agent 循环画布，可用按钮缩放，拖动画布平移':'Minimum Agent loop canvas; zoom with buttons and drag to pan','LLM 决定是否调用工具；工具结果返回上下文，再次进入模型。':'The LLM decides whether to use a tool. Tool output returns to context, then the model runs again.','提出任务':'Provide a task','判断':'Decide','需要工具吗？':'Is a tool needed?','否 → Final Answer':'No → Final Answer','是 → Tool':'Yes → Tool','写回 messages，再次调用 LLM ↺':'Append to messages, then call the LLM again ↺','Agent 的第一个知识点。':'My first Agent concept.','从多种定义中提炼自己的理解，再用工具调用与反馈循环解释最小结构。伪代码尚未运行。':'I compared definitions, formed my own understanding, and described the minimum tool and feedback loop. The pseudocode has not been run.','阅读完整记录 ↗':'Read the full record ↗','从定义与最小循环出发；后续阶段将记录真正的实现与验证。':'Start with definitions and the minimum loop. Future stages will document real implementation and validation.','伪代码未运行':'Pseudocode not run','对照四种定义，写下自己的理解，并画出 LLM → Tool → Tool Result → LLM 的反馈循环。':'I compared four definitions, wrote my own view, and drew the LLM → Tool → Tool Result → LLM feedback loop.','下一步选定具体任务与工具，记录可运行实现及其验证结果。':'Next, choose a task and tool, implement the runnable loop, and record evidence.','最小 Agent Loop':'Minimum Agent Loop','选择节点查看职责。画布展示知识模型，尚不是已运行的系统。':'Select a node to see its role. This is a knowledge model, not a running system.','用户输入进入 LLM。模型若不需要工具，直接返回最终结果；若需要工具，执行 Tool、取得 Tool Result，并把结果作为 tool 消息追加到 messages，再调用 LLM。这个循环可以重复，直到模型不再发起工具调用。':'Input reaches the LLM. If no tool is needed, it returns a final answer. Otherwise a Tool runs, its result is appended to messages as a tool message, and the LLM is called again. The loop continues until there are no more tool calls.','这里的 messages 是当前运行中的上下文；跨会话持久化记忆与独立规划模块尚未加入。':'messages is context for the current run. Persistent memory across sessions and a separate planning module are not present.','定义如何对照':'Comparing definitions','我的理解':'My understanding','最小循环如何运行':'How the minimum loop runs','当前产出':'Current output','下一步的问题':'Questions for next stage','第一个知识点：把工具调用、反馈与再次推理连成一个可解释的循环。':'The first lesson: tool calls, feedback, and another model turn form an explainable loop.','状态：知识整理完成':'Status: knowledge record complete','不同来源，四个侧重点':'Four perspectives on Agent','以下是对官方资料的中文概括，并非逐字引文。':'These are paraphrases of official material, not verbatim quotations.','查看官方资料 ↗':'Read official source ↗','这是我的第一个 Agent 知识点。这里提到的规划和记忆，是我对完整系统的理解；下面的最小循环还没有独立的规划模块或跨会话持久化记忆。':'This is my first Agent concept. Planning and memory are part of my broader understanding; the minimum loop below has neither a separate planner nor persistent memory across sessions.','一次判断，两条分支':'One decision, two branches','① 调用 LLM':'① Call the LLM','② 是否需要 Tool？':'② Is a Tool needed?','否 → 返回结果':'No → return an answer','是 → 执行 Tool → Tool Result → 写回上下文 → 再次调用 LLM ↺':'Yes → run Tool → Tool Result → append to context → call the LLM again ↺','Python · 说明控制流，尚未运行':'Python · Control-flow pseudocode; not run','call_llm 与 run_tool 是抽象接口。错误处理、终止策略、最大迭代次数和持久化留待后续阶段实现。':'call_llm and run_tool are abstract interfaces. Error handling, stopping rules, iteration limits, and persistence remain for later stages.','知识模型 · 代码未运行':'Knowledge model · Code not run','对比将基于后续真实实现，不提前构造虚假的版本差异。':'Comparisons will use future real implementations, not invented version differences.','等待第一个可运行版本':'Waiting for the first runnable version','目前只有 REV 00 的知识模型。第一阶段完成可运行实现后，这里会列出实际架构的新增、修改与原因。':'Only the REV 00 knowledge model exists. After a runnable Stage 01, this page will show actual changes and their reasons.'
